# terraform.tfvars is COMMITTED (public values only), so `tofu plan` works from a fresh clone.
#
# The ONE file you must create is emails.auto.tfvars, gitignored because it holds personal
# addresses and this repo is public:
#
#   e2e_budget_alert_emails = ["you@example.com"]
#
# Required, no default: a default of [] would make a bare apply silently drop the cost alerts.
# Pass [] explicitly to opt out.
#
# You also need backend.hcl (see backend.hcl.example), and the bootstrap applied first (bootstrap/).
